  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/248a2102-674c-431b-90ac-575aa25d77f3.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:2.70694in;height:1.67361in\" /><br />Area <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msubsup><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>where <math><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> are roots of the equation <math><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math><br />Hence, the required area <math><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;sq. units</p>",
